OL,3,GNEWSA'I love to escape into a
OL,4,Afantasyland of fairies': Fans rejoice
OL,5,Aas new A Court of Thorns and Roses book
OL,6,Ahits shelves
OL,7,
OL,8,FTorrential rain and high winds may not
OL,9,Fbe what many would consider
OL,10,Ffantastical.
OL,12,FBut it didn't stop about 30 hardcore
OL,13,Ffans turning out for the latest release
OL,14,Fof author Sarah J Maas' romantasy
OL,15,Fseries, A Court of Splintered Harmony,
OL,16,Fin Carrickfergus, County Antrim.
OL,18,FThe sixth book in Maas's multi-million
OL,19,Fbook selling series, A Court of Thorns
OL,20,Fand Roses (ACOTAR), was released at
OL,21,Fmidnight on Tuesday after a five-year
OL,22,Fwait.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
